Condition : 3 - Details in respect of the following shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority before the relevant work is begun. 

"	A schedule of the existing windows for both the Chapel and Isleworth House and specification for their repair;
"	Drawings at 1:5 with details of glazing bars at 1:1 of the proposed new windows for Isleworth House, the Chapel, the Lodge and the stable block;
"	Details of the proposed new staircases, balustrades and mezzanine for the Chapel; and
"	Details of the links between the Lodge and Extra-Care building and Orangery and Isleworth House

The relevant work shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details.
